msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we release Quarkus 2.4.0.Final which includes a lot of refinements "
"and improvements and some new features:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Reactive 1.0.0.Final"
msgstr ""

msgid "Introducing Kafka Streams DevUI"
msgstr ""

msgid "Support continuous testing for multi module projects"
msgstr ""

msgid "Support AWT image resize via new AWT extension"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To migrate from 2.3, please refer to link:https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.4[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Among other fixes and improvements, in this release all methods which \"open "
"a session\" have been made reactive."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Please, refer to the link:https://hibernate.org/reactive/documentation/1.0/"
"reference/html_single/#getting-started[getting started documentation] to "
"find out more about the release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kafka Streams DevUI"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Quarkus DevUI now includes support for the topology visualizer, which "
"looks like link:https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/593564/136768958-"
"9a66c25b-c3fa-4a6c-9211-8cedd845eb55.png[this example]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Continuous testing for multi module projects"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Continuous testing will now run tests from all the project modules, with the "
"option to configure the old behaviour. The new config options include:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"quarkus.test.only-test-application-module (default value is false) - if "
"false then tests from all dependency modules will be run as well;"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"quarkus.test.include-module-pattern - a regular expression matched against "
"the module groupId:artifactId, tests from the matched modules will be "
"included in the continuous testing;"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"quarkus.test.exclude-module-pattern (ignored if `include-module-pattern` has "
"been set) - a regular expression and is matched against the module groupId:"
"artifactId, tests from the matched modules will be excluded from the "
"continuous testing."
msgstr ""

msgid "AWT image resize via new AWT extension"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A new `io.quarkus:quarkus-awt` extension for AWT and Java2D usage was added "
"to enable various AWT use-cases, such as image resizing."
msgstr ""

